He probably means eating the baby dragons. They are tame, and if you are
truly chaotic you would probably get a rush out of offing your pets,
and eating them (likely even raw :-].)


About the polymorph, I always found that the higher your constitution,
the less your likelihood of failing the saving throw and turning into
a new man. So adjust your constitution, and take your polymorph ring
off for a while between changes. The higher your level, the longer
you are able to stay in a changed form.

Also, this may be superstition, but blessing the rings seems to me to be
helpful in i) successfully polymorphing ii) polymorphing into a tougher
monster (hit point wise) and iii) time expired between placing the
polymorph ring on my finger and changing form.

Lastly, a blessed luckstone can never hurt !!

